    <preface>
      <p>Private Health Insurance Legislation Amendment (Age of Dependants) Act 2021</p>
      <p>No. 60, 2021</p>
      <p>An Act to amend the <i>Private Health Insurance Act 2007</i>, and for other purposes</p>
      <p>Contents</p>
      <p>1	Short title	1</p>
      <p>2	Commencement	2</p>
      <p>3	Schedules	2</p>
      <p>Schedule 1—Amendments	3</p>
      <p>Age Discrimination Act 2004	3</p>
      <p>Private Health Insurance Act 2007	3</p>
      <p>Private Health Insurance (Prudential Supervision) Act 2015	6</p>
      <p>Private Health Insurance Legislation Amendment (Age of Dependants) Act 2021</p>
      <p>No. 60, 2021</p>
      <p>An Act to amend the <i>Private Health Insurance Act 2007</i>, and for other purposes</p>
      <p>[<i>Assented to 29 June 2021</i>]</p>
      <formula name="enacting">
        <p>The Parliament of Australia enacts:</p>
      </formula>
    </preface>
    <body>
      <section eId="sec-1">
        <num>1</num>
        <heading>Short title</heading>
        <content>
          <p>		This Act is the <i>Private Health Insurance Legislation Amendment (Age of Dependants)</i><i> Act 20</i><i>21</i>.</p>
        </content>
      </section>
      <section eId="sec-2">
        <num>2</num>
        <heading>Commencement</heading>
        <subsection eId="sec-2__subsec-1">
          <num>1</num>
          <content>
            <p>Each provision of this Act specified in column 1 of the table commences, or is taken to have commenced, in accordance with column 2 of the table. Any other statement in column 2 has effect according to its terms.</p>
          </content>
          <table>
            <tr>
              <th>Commencement information</th>
              <th>Commencement information</th>
              <th>Commencement information</th>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Column 1</td>
              <td>Column 2</td>
              <td>Column 3</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Provisions</td>
              <td>Commencement</td>
              <td>Date/Details</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>1.  The whole of this Act</td>
              <td>1 April 2021.</td>
              <td>1 April 2021</td>
            </tr>
          </table>
          <authorialNote placement="end" eId="note-1" marker="1">
            <content>
              <p>Note:	This table relates only to the provisions of this Act as originally enacted. It will not be amended to deal with any later amendments of this Act.</p>
            </content>
          </authorialNote>
        </subsection>
        <subsection eId="sec-2__subsec-2">
          <num>2</num>
          <content>
            <p>Any information in column 3 of the table is not part of this Act. Information may be inserted in this column, or information in it may be edited, in any published version of this Act.</p>
          </content>
        </subsection>
      </section>
      <section eId="sec-3">
        <num>3</num>
        <heading>Schedules</heading>
        <content>
          <p>Legislation that is specified in a Schedule to this Act is amended or repealed as set out in the applicable items in the Schedule concerned, and any other item in a Schedule to this Act has effect according to its terms.</p>
        </content>
      </section>
    </body>
    <attachments>
      <attachment>
        <hcontainer name="schedule" eId="schedule-1">
          <num>1</num>
          <heading>Amendments</heading>
          <hcontainer name="amendedAct" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1">
            <heading>Age Discrimination Act 2004</heading>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-1">
              <num>1</num>
              <heading>Schedule 2 (table item 9A, column headed “Provision(s)”)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Omit “sections 22-15 and 22-25”, substitute “sections 22-5, 22-15, 22-25 and 22-30”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
          </hcontainer>
          <hcontainer name="amendedAct" eId="schedule-1__amdact-2">
            <heading>Private Health Insurance Act 2007</heading>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-1">
              <num>2</num>
              <heading>Subsection 22-5(2) (heading)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Omit “<i>Dependent child</i><i>-</i><i>only</i>”, substitute “<i>Dependent person</i><i>-</i><i>only</i>”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-2">
              <num>3</num>
              <heading>Subsection 22-5(2)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Omit “*dependent children”, substitute “*dependent persons”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-3">
              <num>4</num>
              <heading>Subsection 22-5(3)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Omit “*dependent children”, substitute “*dependent persons”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-4">
              <num>5</num>
              <heading>Paragraph 22-5(4)(c)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Omit “*dependent child”, substitute “*dependent person”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-5">
              <num>6</num>
              <heading>Subsection 22-15(5) (note 2)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Omit “dependent children”, substitute “dependent persons”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-6">
              <num>7</num>
              <heading>Paragraph 22-25(1)(b)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Omit “*dependent child”, substitute “*dependent person”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-7">
              <num>8</num>
              <heading>Subsection 22-25(2)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Omit “*dependent child”, substitute “*dependent person”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-8">
              <num>9</num>
              <heading>Paragraph 22-30(1)(b)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Omit “*dependent child”, substitute “*dependent person”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-9">
              <num>10</num>
              <heading>Subsection 63-5(4)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Omit “*dependent child non-student”, substitute “*dependent non-student or *dependent person with a disability”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-10">
              <num>11</num>
              <heading>Subsection 63-5(4)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>After “*dependent children”, insert “or *dependent students”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-11">
              <num>12</num>
              <heading>Subsection 63-5(4)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Omit “dependent child non-student” (last occurring), substitute “dependent non-student or dependent person with a disability”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-12">
              <num>13</num>
              <heading>Subsection 63-5(5)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Repeal the subsection.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-13">
              <num>14</num>
              <heading>Paragraph 333-20(1)(a)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Omit “or section”, substitute “, section or Schedule”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-14">
              <num>15</num>
              <heading>Subsection 333-20(1) (table, heading to column headed “Chapter/Part/section”)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Repeal the heading, substitute:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-14__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <table>
                  <tr>
                    <td>Chapter/Part/section/Schedule</td>
                  </tr>
                </table>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-15">
              <num>16</num>
              <heading>Subsection 333-20(1) (table item 3, column headed “Chapter/Part/section”)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Omit “and <ref href="#sec-188">section 188</ref>-1”, substitute “, <ref href="#sec-188">section 188</ref>-1 and Schedule 1”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-16">
              <num>17</num>
              <heading>Clause 1 of Schedule 1 (definition of adult)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Repeal the definition, substitute:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-16__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <content>
                  <p><b><i>adult</i></b>:</p>
                </content>
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-16__qstr-1__para-a">
                  <num>a</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>when used outside <ref href="#part-2">Part 2</ref>-3—means a person who is not a *dependent person; or</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-16__qstr-1__para-b">
                  <num>b</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>when used in <ref href="#part-2">Part 2</ref>-3—means a person who is not:</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-16__qstr-1__para-i">
                  <num>i</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>a *dependent child; or</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-16__qstr-1__para-ii">
                  <num>ii</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>a *dependent non-student; or</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-16__qstr-1__para-iii">
                  <num>iii</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>a *dependent student.</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-17">
              <num>18</num>
              <heading>Clause 1 of Schedule 1 (definition of dependent child)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Repeal the definition, substitute:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-17__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <content>
                  <p><b><i>dependent child</i></b> means a person who:</p>
                </content>
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-17__qstr-1__para-a">
                  <num>a</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>is aged under 18; and</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-17__qstr-1__para-b">
                  <num>b</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>does not have a partner.</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-18">
              <num>19</num>
              <heading>Clause 1 of Schedule 1 (definition of dependent child non-student)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Repeal the definition.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-19">
              <num>20</num>
              <heading>Clause 1 of Schedule 1</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Insert:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-19__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <content>
                  <p><b><i>dependent non</i></b><b><i>-</i></b><b><i>student</i></b> means a person who:</p>
                </content>
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-19__qstr-1__para-a">
                  <num>a</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>is aged between 18 and 31 (inclusive); and</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-19__qstr-1__para-b">
                  <num>b</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>is not receiving full-time education at a school, college or university; and</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-19__qstr-1__para-c">
                  <num>c</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>is a dependent non-student under the *rules of the private health insurer that insures the person; and</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-19__qstr-1__para-d">
                  <num>d</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>does not have a partner.</p>
                  </content>
                  <content>
                    <p><b><i>dependent person</i></b> means:</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-19__qstr-1__para-a-2">
                  <num>a</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>a *dependent child; or</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-19__qstr-1__para-b-2">
                  <num>b</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>a *dependent non-student; or</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-19__qstr-1__para-c-2">
                  <num>c</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>a *dependent person with a disability; or</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-19__qstr-1__para-d-2">
                  <num>d</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>a *dependent student.</p>
                  </content>
                  <content>
                    <p><b><i>dependent person with a disability</i></b> means a person:</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-19__qstr-1__para-a-3">
                  <num>a</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>who is aged 18 or over; and</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-19__qstr-1__para-b-3">
                  <num>b</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>who is:</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-19__qstr-1__para-i">
                  <num>i</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>	(i)	a person with a disability within the meaning of the expression <b><i>person with a disability</i></b> as defined by the Private Health Insurance (Complying Product) Rules; or</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-19__qstr-1__para-ii">
                  <num>ii</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>	(ii)	a person with a disability within the meaning of the expression <b><i>person with a disability</i></b> as defined by the *rules of the private health insurer that insures the person.</p>
                  </content>
                  <content>
                    <p>To avoid doubt, a <b><i>dependent person with a disability</i></b> may have a partner.</p>
                    <p><b><i>dependent student</i></b> means a person who:</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-19__qstr-1__para-a-4">
                  <num>a</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>is aged between 18 and 31 (inclusive); and</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-19__qstr-1__para-b-4">
                  <num>b</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>is receiving full-time education at a school, college or university; and</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-19__qstr-1__para-c-3">
                  <num>c</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>is a dependent student under the *rules of the private health insurer that insures the person; and</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-19__qstr-1__para-d-3">
                  <num>d</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>does not have a partner.</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-20">
              <num>21</num>
              <heading>Clause 1 of Schedule 1 (definition of holder)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Omit “*dependent child”, substitute “*dependent person”.</p>
                <p>22  Application</p>
                <p>The amendment of paragraph 22-30(1)(b) of the <i>Private Health Insurance Act 2007</i> made by this Schedule applies in relation to the following days:</p>
              </content>
              <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-20__para-a">
                <num>a</num>
                <content>
                  <p><date date="2021-04-01">1 April 2021</date>;</p>
                </content>
              </paragraph>
              <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-20__para-b">
                <num>b</num>
                <content>
                  <p>each later day.</p>
                </content>
              </paragraph>
            </hcontainer>
          </hcontainer>
          <hcontainer name="amendedAct" eId="schedule-1__amdact-3">
            <heading>Private Health Insurance (Prudential Supervision) Act 2015</heading>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-3__item-1">
              <num>23</num>
              <heading>Subsection 4(1) (definition of dependent child)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Repeal the definition.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-3__item-2">
              <num>24</num>
              <heading>Subsection 4(1)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Insert:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-3__item-2__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <content>
                  <p><b><i>dependent person</i></b> has the same meaning as in the <i>Private Health Insurance Act 2007</i>.</p>
                </content>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-3__item-3">
              <num>25</num>
              <heading>Subsection 15(4)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Omit “dependent children”, substitute “dependent persons”.</p>
                <p>[<i>Minister’s second reading speech made in—</i></p>
                <p><i>House of Representatives on 25 February 2021</i></p>
                <p><i>Senate on 18 March 2021</i>]</p>
                <p>(8/21)</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
          </hcontainer>
        </hcontainer>
